      {
        "id": 86224,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-09T16:58:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"SuperRick\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/superrick/48/2705_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> SuperRick:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I know someone has asked the question before, so forgive me for being the guy to ask it again.When a villian destroys ongoing cards, does that apply also to technology cards (and vice versa)?&nbsp; From my understanding they operate the same, but have different titles.&nbsp;Thanks.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>To clarify, they are Equipment cards. And no, an effect that destroys Ongoing cards does not apply to Equipment cards and vice versa.&nbsp;</p>",
