        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/superrick/{size}/2705_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-10T16:02:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the clarification.&nbsp; I've played games that add new things with new editions/expansions and by doing that they have to make the old cards apply to the new cards even when the verbiage isn't the same.&nbsp; Gets confusing.&nbsp; What I like about the &lt;Games crew is that it seems they have the whole plan on paper (to some degree) so you don't have any of that sort of thing going on.</p>",
